<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT DUKE OF NORFOLK'S XI BY 113 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT DUKE OF NORFOLK'S XI BY 113 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>ARUNDEL, England 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat the Duke of Norfolk's XI by 113 runs in their opening one-day tour match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235-5 in 50 overs (M.Slater 50 not out).</p>
<p>Duke of Norfolk's XI 122 in 34.5 overs (J.Gillespie 4-21).</p>
